.TH ACL_GETFACL 1 "December 2024" "Network Security" "Lab Commands"
.SH NAME
acl_getfacl_lab \- getfacl command quick lab reference
.SH DESCRIPTION
View ACL permissions of files and directories.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B Show ACL of a file
getfacl file.txt
.TP
.B Show ACL of a directory
getfacl /shared/
.SH LAB CHALLENGES
.TP
.B Check which user has write permissions
getfacl file.txt
.TP
.B Verify default ACL inheritance on a folder
getfacl /shared/
.SH AUTHOR
Exam preparation cheat-sheet.

